tf","text":"メカ娘を描いたAIイラスト。淡い水色の背景に、長い水色のツインテールを大きく結い上げた少女が正面向きで立っている。赤い瞳とほんのり赤らんだ頬が印象的で、黒いヘッドギアのような機械パーツを頭部に装着している。衣装は光沢のあるターコイズブルーのボディスーツ風ミニドレスで、胸元から胴体にかけて黒と白の装甲パーツが重なっている。両腕は黒を基調としたメカアームで、白い装甲ユニットが肩から前腕に付いている。太ももには黒いタイツ状のパーツを着用している。背景には同じキャラクターの大きな半透明の上半身が重ねて描かれており、全体としてクリーンな線画とフラット寄りの彩色で仕上げられた、近未来的なアニメ風イラスト。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"53p8c","text":"An AI-generated illustration of a mecha girl. Against a pale aqua background, a girl with long aqua twin-tails stands facing forward. Her red eyes and slightly flushed cheeks stand out, and she wears black mechanical headgear on both sides of her head. She is dressed in a glossy turquoise bodysuit-like mini dress, with layered black and white armored parts running across her chest and torso. Both arms are mechanical, primarily black with white armor units attached from the shoulders to the forearms. She also wears black thigh-high components on her legs. In the background, a large semi-transparent portrait of the same character is overlaid behind her, creating a layered composition. The piece is rendered in a clean futuristic anime style with crisp linework and relatively flat coloring.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":24,"length":9,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"apcuv","text":"メカ娘のポスト一覧","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":25,"length":5,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aqnic","text":"◆メカ女子","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":26,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"361s9","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9hck4","text":"メカ女子を描いたAIイラスト。白い背景の中央に大きな水色の長方形が配置され、その前に茶色の髪とオレンジ色の瞳を持つ少女が全身像で描かれている。髪は後ろで小さく結ばれ、顔の両側に長い毛束が垂れている。頭部の左右にはグレーの機械装備が取り付けられている。服装は、赤いスカーフが付いた白い半袖セーラー服に、白いラインの入ったグレーのプリーツスカート。両腕は肩から先が銀色の機械義手になっており、肘や手首、指の関節まで細かい機械構造が描かれている。両脚も膝上から足先まで重厚な機械脚で、銀色の装甲と関節機構、つま先のオレンジ色の装飾が特徴的。少女は片脚を少し前に出して身体を傾け、右手の機械義手を額の横に掲げて敬礼している。左腕は自然に下ろし、頬をほんのり赤らめながら穏やかに微笑んでいる。白と水色を基調としたシンプルな構図に、精密なメカ装備と少女らしい柔らかな表情を組み合わせた、明瞭な輪郭線とフラットな彩色のアニメ調イラスト。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d88c8","text":"An AI-generated illustration of a mecha girl. Against a white background featuring a large light blue rectangle, a girl with brown hair and orange eyes is depicted in a full-body standing pose. Her hair is tied back in a small ponytail, with long strands framing both sides of her face. Gray mechanical devices are attached to both sides of her head. She wears a white short-sleeved sailor-style school uniform with a red neckerchief and a gray pleated skirt decorated with white stripes. Both arms are silver mechanical prosthetics from the shoulders down, featuring intricate mechanical structures around the elbows, wrists, and finger joints. Both legs are also heavily mechanized from above the knees to the feet, with silver armor plating, visible joint mechanisms, and orange accents on the toes. She stands with one leg slightly forward and her body gently tilted, raising her right mechanical hand beside her forehead in a salute. Her left arm hangs naturally at her side, and she smiles softly with faintly flushed cheeks. The anime-style illustration combines detailed mechanical equipment with a gentle character expression, featuring clean outlines, flat coloring, and a simple white-and-blue composition.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":27,"length":11,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7kmtt","text":"◆メカ女子のポスト一覧","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":28,"length":9,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ebube","text":"◆Elf Girl","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":29,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9f8kj","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ici7","text":"⠀エルフを描いたAIイラスト。柔らかな木漏れ日が降り注ぐ緑豊かな花園で、長い淡い金髪と青緑色の瞳を持つエルフの少女が、白い花々に囲まれて座っている。髪は前髪を斜めに流したストレートのロングヘアで、肩から胸元へと柔らかく垂れている。横に大きく伸びた尖った耳が特徴的で、頬をほんのり赤らめながら、歯を見せていたずらっぽく微笑んでいる。服装は淡いグレーのノースリーブワンピースで、胸元は深いV字型になっており、肩や胸元、腰のあたりには小さな白い花が飾られている。片手を膝の上に添え、もう片方の手を身体の横に置いて、少し首を傾けながらこちらを見つめている。周囲には黄色い花芯を持つ白い花々が咲き乱れ、背景には緑の葉や木々が柔らかくぼかされている。暖かな陽光が髪や肌、衣装にまだらな光を落とし、透明感のある色彩と繊細な陰影で描かれた幻想的なアニメ調イラスト。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"66a51","text":"An AI-generated illustration of an elf girl. In a lush flower garden bathed in soft, dappled sunlight, an elf girl with long pale blonde hair and blue-green eyes sits surrounded by white blossoms. Her straight hair features side-swept bangs and falls gently over her shoulders and chest. Her long, pointed ears extend prominently outward, and her cheeks are faintly flushed as she smiles mischievously, showing her teeth. She wears a pale gray sleeveless dress with a deep V-shaped neckline, decorated with small white flowers around the shoulders, chest, and waist. One hand rests on her knee while the other is placed beside her body, and she tilts her head slightly as she gazes toward the viewer. White flowers with yellow centers bloom all around her, while green leaves and trees are softly blurred in the background. Warm sunlight creates scattered highlights across her hair, skin, and dress. The fantasy-inspired anime illustration features luminous colors, delicate shading, and a gentle, dreamlike atmosphere.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":30,"length":15,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bugc5","text":"Elf Girl のポスト一覧","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":31,"length":7,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fmse1","text":"◆失恋ガールズ","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":32,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"v5v1","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ft1fm","text":"コマリちゃんを描いたAIイラスト。黒い縁取りのある1コマ漫画風の構図で、薄い背景の中央に、女子高生のコマリちゃんがまっすぐ立っている。短めの明るい茶髪ボブに、半目気味の冷静な表情、うっすら赤い頬が特徴で、腕を組んでこちらを見ている。服装はベージュのカーディガン、グレーのセーラー襟、白いインナー、赤いリボン、グレーのプリーツスカート、黒いハイソックス、茶色のローファー。全身の周囲には巨大な金色の炎のオーラが激しく噴き上がり、さらに青い電撃が何本も走っていて、強いパワーアップ演出になっている。右上の青い吹き出しには「不知火…」、左下の青い吹き出しには「なんで『超化』してるんだ…？」と書かれている。アニメ調の線で描かれた、迫力と少しシュールさのある漫画風イラスト。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"36lha","text":"An AI-generated illustration of Komari-chan. The image is framed like a single-panel manga with a black border. In the center, Komari-chan, a high school girl, stands facing forward. She has a short light-brown bob haircut, slightly half-lidded eyes, a calm serious expression, and lightly flushed cheeks, with her arms folded as she looks toward the viewer. She wears a beige cardigan, gray sailor-style collar, white inner shirt, red ribbon, gray pleated skirt, black knee-high socks, and brown loafers. Around her whole body, a massive golden flaming aura erupts upward, with several streaks of bright blue lightning surrounding her, creating a dramatic powered-up effect. A blue speech bubble at the upper right says “不知火…”, and another blue speech bubble at the lower left says “なんで『超化』してるんだ…？”. The illustration has clean anime-style linework and a dynamic manga-like mix of intensity and humor.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":33,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1sf4l","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9q67l","text":"コマリちゃんを描いたAIイラスト。黒い枠線で囲まれた1コマ漫画風の構図で、茶色のショートボブと琥珀色のジト目が特徴的な女子高生のコマリちゃんが、身体を少し斜めに向けて立っている。服装はグレーのセーラー襟と赤いリボンが付いた白い制服に、ベージュのカーディガン、グレーのプリーツスカート。両腕を胸の前で強く組み、頬を真っ赤に染めながら、眉を寄せて口を開いた照れ隠しのような怒った表情をしている。全身の周囲には巨大な黄金色の炎のオーラが激しく噴き上がり、鮮やかな水色の電撃が何本も走っている。右上の吹き出しには「ちょっとアンタ!!」、左側の吹き出しには「は 話があるんだけど」とあり、小さく「顔かしなさいよ」と添えられている。左下の水色の強調された吹き出しには「とうとう告られるのか？ おしまいだぁ」と書かれている。恋愛の告白を切り出そうとする緊張感を、戦闘漫画のような激しいオーラと電撃で表現した、迫力とユーモアのあるアニメ調イラスト。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4k38u","text":"An AI-generated illustration of Komari-chan. Framed like a single-panel manga with a black border, Komari-chan, a high school girl with short brown bobbed hair and half-lidded amber eyes, stands with her body turned slightly to one side. She wears a white sailor-style school uniform with a gray collar and red bow, a beige cardigan, and a gray pleated skirt. Her arms are tightly crossed over her chest, her cheeks are deeply flushed, and she speaks with furrowed brows and an angry-looking expression that seems to conceal her embarrassment. An enormous golden flame-like aura erupts around her entire body, accompanied by several streaks of bright cyan lightning. The speech bubble at the upper right reads, “Hey, you!!” The bubble on the left says, “I-I have something to talk to you about,” with smaller text adding, “Come with me for a moment.” The emphasized light blue bubble at the lower left reads, “Is she finally going to confess her feelings? I'm doomed!” The manga-style anime illustration humorously portrays the tension of a romantic confession through an exaggerated, battle-anime-style aura of flames and lightning.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":34,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"64k60","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4qibb","text":"コマリちゃんを描いたAIイラスト。黒い縁取りのある1コマ漫画風の構図で、薄いグレーの無地背景の中、女子高生のコマリちゃんがこちらを見上げるような俯瞰構図で描かれている。髪は明るい茶色のロングヘアで、前髪が目にかかるように下りており、頬を赤らめた半目気味の表情で、口を開けて楽しげに笑っている。両手で顔の左右にVサインを作り、目元を囲むようなポーズをしている。服装はベージュのカーディガン、グレーのセーラー襟、白いインナー、赤いリボン、グレーのプリーツスカートで、太ももの一部も見えている。左上には黄色の強調マークが描かれ、左下の吹き出しには「にじぴっぴ♪」と書かれている。線はすっきりしたアニメ調で、ややいたずらっぽく可愛らしい雰囲気のイラスト。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"14i6s","text":"An AI-generated illustration of Komari-chan. The image is framed like a single-panel manga with a black border and a plain light gray background. Komari-chan, a high school girl, is shown from a slightly top-down perspective as if she is looking up toward the viewer. She has long light-brown hair with bangs falling over her eyes, flushed cheeks, half-lidded eyes, and an open cheerful smile. She poses with both hands making peace signs on either side of her face, framing her eyes. She wears a beige cardigan, a gray sailor-style collar, a white inner shirt, a red ribbon, and a gray pleated skirt, with part of her thighs visible. Yellow emphasis marks appear near the upper left. A speech bubble in the lower left reads “にじぴっぴ♪”. The illustration uses clean anime-style linework and has a playful, cute, slightly teasing mood.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":35,"length":12,"offset":0},{"key":36,"length":6,"offset":13}],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":5,"offset":13,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"2spgd","text":"失恋ガールズのポスト一覧\nてんねんの𝕏","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"34","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"1da9b7d8-2f2a-454c-b5d9-4d253608f0f8","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"20","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2118299399675904000"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"12","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"8dc6dffd-6212-4f12-8322-1426ab6291a8","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"37","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2118169627675209728"},{"localMediaId":"38","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2118169627671068673"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"8","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"e2fd1bcb-76e1-46b6-9cc1-016b69faa747","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"21","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2118167638635646976"},{"localMediaId":"22","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2118167638644011008"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"19","value":{"data":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/10nen_/"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"LINK"}},{"key":"23","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"67fae050-74a3-4a14-9485-51226a25884a","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"35","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2118299848197971968"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","typ